# Rules to skip for specific paths in this crate.
# Format: RULE/name:path/glob — gitignore-style glob relative to crate root.
# Every entry requires a WHY: comment. No blanket category ignores.

# WHY: syntonia exposes the radio frequency plan model (`Channel`,
# `FrequencyPlan`, `ToneMode`, `CtcssTone`, baofeng/yaesu protocol types,
# etc.) via lib.rs `pub use`. These types and their methods need `pub` at
# definition sites for the re-exports to resolve (Rust E0365/E0624). The
# RUST/pub-visibility rule exempts lib.rs/mod.rs but does not follow
# `pub use` chains into defining files.
RUST/pub-visibility:src/**
